---
import Title from "~/components/Title.astro";
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - ViClip"
  description="ViClip's privacy policy. Learn how we protect your data in our universal clipboard sync app. Transparent data handling across Windows, macOS, Linux, iOS, and Android."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-28 pb-32">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <Title class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Privacy Policy</Title>
      <p class="text-dark/60 text-sm">Last Updated: April 6, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <article class="max-w-none space-y-10 text-dark/90 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg">
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how ViClip ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, discloses,
          and safeguards your information when you use our ViClip applications across Web, Desktop,
          and Mobile, along with related services (collectively, the "Service").
        </p>
        <p>
          We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. We
          encourage you to read this Privacy Policy carefully to understand our practices regarding
          your information and how we treat it. For the terms governing your use of our applications,
          please also review our
          <a href="/terms-of-service" class="text-coral underline hover:opacity-80">
            Terms of Service
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following types of information to provide and maintain the Service:</p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-dark mt-6">2.1 Personal Information</h3>
        <p>When you create an account, we collect authentication information, which may include:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Account credentials (managed securely via Firebase Authentication)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-dark mt-6">2.2 Clipboard Data & Zero-Knowledge Encryption</h3>
        <p>
          The primary function of our Service is to synchronize clipboard content across your
          devices. ViClip employs <strong>Client-Side Zero-Knowledge Encryption (AES-256-GCM)</strong>.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>
            Clipboard content is encrypted and decrypted locally on your device before transmission.
          </li>
          <li>
            Our backend servers only receive encrypted ciphertext payloads. We never store or
            have access to your plaintext clipboard content or encryption master keys.
          </li>
          <li>
            Device metadata (platform, device name, and last active timestamp) is stored to manage
            connected clients.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-dark mt-6">2.3 Usage Information</h3>
        <p>
          We may automatically collect limited technical information about your device environment to
          diagnose issues, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Device type and operating system version (Windows, macOS, Linux, iOS, Android)</li>
          <li>Application version and error diagnostics</li>
          <li>Synchronization connectivity status</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the collected information solely to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Provide, maintain, and optimize cross-device clipboard synchronization</li>
          <li>Authenticate your account and authorize connected client devices</li>
          <li>Send security alerts, critical service updates, and account notices</li>
          <li>Detect, prevent, and address technical issues or security vulnerabilities</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">4. How We Share Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, trade, or monetize your personal or clipboard data. We
          may only share information under strict operational requirements:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>
            <strong>Infrastructure Providers:</strong> Trusted cloud infrastructure (Firebase /
            Google Cloud) used strictly to host encrypted payloads and authentication services.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Compliance with Laws:</strong> Only when required by valid legal process or
            applicable statutory obligations.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          ViClip is designed with privacy-by-default architecture:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption for all clip content</li>
          <li>Key Encryption Keys (KEK) derived client-side via PBKDF2 with SHA-256</li>
          <li>Encrypted payload format (<code class="bg-dark/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">iv:authTag:ciphertext</code>) verifying cryptographic integrity</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">6. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
        <p>You have full ownership and control over your data:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Clear History:</strong> Delete individual clips or purge your entire clipboard history at any time.</li>
          <li><strong>Disconnect Devices:</strong> Revoke access for any connected device from your account settings.</li>
          <li><strong>Delete Account:</strong> Request permanent deletion of your account and all associated encrypted data.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Your encrypted clipboard data is retained in accordance with your configured history limits
          or until explicitly deleted. Account records are kept as long as your account remains active.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our Service is not directed to individuals under the age of 13. We do not knowingly
          collect personal information from children under 13.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material
          changes by posting the updated policy on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-dark">10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or feedback about this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us at
          <a href="mailto:support@viclip.shipby.me" class="text-coral underline hover:opacity-80">
            support@viclip.shipby.me
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
